cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, cite this repository and the release tag or source commit for the result you use."
title: "Cart-Pole: 1D and 2D Control in MuJoCo"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sorenson
    given-names: Corben
repository-code: "https://github.com/corbensorenson/cartpole"
url: "https://github.com/corbensorenson/cartpole"
abstract: >-
  MuJoCo control benchmarks for a one-dimensional rail cart with a passive
  planar hinge chain and a two-dimensional XY cart with a passive spatial
  ball-joint chain. The repository includes trajectory optimization and
  feedback controllers, frozen source and controller identities, benchmark
  evidence, technical appendices, and full swing-up and hold videos.
